          "item": "Require phishing-resistant MFA for Microsoft Entra administrator roles",
          "source": "Microsoft Entra documentation"
        }
      ],
      "id": "cap-001",
      "intent": "People with administrator roles must prove who they are with a strong, phishing resistant sign in method.",
      "knownOptionalDeviations": [
